# Regression: type alias with a field named "type:" should not be confused with
# the @[type: T] annotation shorthand.
# [Thing: [type [type: String  id: Integer]]] declares a record type with a field
# literally named "type", not a type-expression shorthand.
[
  Thing: [type [type: String  id: Integer]]
  t: [@Thing [type: "widget"  id: 1]]
]
=== out
["Thing": []  "t": ["type": "widget"  "id": 1]]
